# PMS (entry)

Concern rules layer on via tighter globs (`pms-api`, `pms-query`, `pms-ui`). Map: [`.cursor/rules/README.md`](README.md).

- React + Vite + Tailwind + shadcn. Staff ops only → `apps/api`.
- UI/UX: always read `shadcn` + `product-ui-design` skills; apply with judgment — `pms-ui.mdc`.
- Server state (query/mutate/errors): `pms-query.mdc`.
- Calendar, reservations, check-in/out, quick-confirm first.
- Read `apps/pms/AGENTS.md`.
